IAAS API (SQLite)
==================

Simple API for IAAS using SQLite, JWT auth, and members endpoints.

Setup
-----
1. Copy `.env.example` to `.env` and edit values.
2. Install deps and start:

```bash
cd backend/api-sqlite
npm install
npm start
```

Endpoints
---------
- `POST /api/auth/register` {name,email,password}
- `POST /api/auth/login` {email,password} => returns token and user
- `POST /api/members` create a member (body includes email etc.)
- `GET /api/members/me?email=` get member by email or authenticated user
- `GET /api/members` list all members (no admin protection by default)
- `POST /api/members/migrate` import array of members (body.members)

Notes
-----
- Configure `NOTIFY_SERVER_URL` in `.env` to forward created members to your notify server.
- This is a minimal scaffold; for production secure the endpoints, add rate-limits, input validation, and use HTTPS.
